OL,3,GNEWSAWork begins on new hotel and bar
OL,4,Aon site of landmark former venue
OL,5,
OL,6,FWork is finally under way to build a
OL,7,Fnew promenade hotel and bar development
OL,8,Fon what was once a landmark Art Deco
OL,9,Fstyle building on the land in
OL,10,FBlackpool.
OL,12,FThe original multi-million pound plans
OL,13,Fto regenerate the former Yates Wine
OL,14,FLodge in South Shore were scrapped as
OL,15,Flong-term deterioration of its concrete
OL,16,Fand steel structure meant the building
OL,17,Fcould not be made safe - and had to be
OL,18,Fdemolished in November last year.
OL,20,FBlackpool Council planners approved
OL,21,Ffresh proposals to build a new version
OL,22,Fof the hotel and bar in February.
OL,23,APub: 17-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB NW Eng NewsC Reg TVF Weather
FL,404,400,260,160,0,100
