OL,3,GNEWSAWork begins on new hotel and bar
OL,4,Aon site of landmark former venue
OL,5,
OL,6,FThis week the site became a hive of
OL,7,Factivity, with workmen making the site
OL,8,Fready for construction to begin with a
OL,9,Fmember of the team saying the building
OL,10,Fwas expected to be completed by next
OL,11,Fyear.
